WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.076 --> 00:00:27.771
Peter and Benjamin were in the farmer's field.

2
00:00:27.772 --> 00:00:32.323
"Tag!" Peter cried. "You're it!"

3
00:00:32.324 --> 00:00:35.048
Benjamin chased Peter.

4
00:00:35.049 --> 00:00:40.466
The lambs were in the yard with Kep.

5
00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:45.953
They watched the bunnies play tag.

6
00:00:45.954 --> 00:00:49.939
"We want to play too!" the lambs said.

7
00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:53.932
They hopped and skipped to the field.

8
00:00:53.933 --> 00:00:56.666
Kep barked at the lambs.

9
00:00:56.667 --> 00:00:59.650
"Where are you going?"

10
00:00:59.651 --> 00:01:04.043
"They want to play tag," Peter called.

11
00:01:04.044 --> 00:01:06.300
"No!" Kep said.

12
00:01:06.301 --> 00:01:08.543
"The lambs must stay in the yard.

13
00:01:08.544 --> 00:01:10.969
I must watch them."

14
00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.885
Benjamin frowned.

15
00:01:12.886 --> 00:01:16.421
"We can watch the lambs."

16
00:01:16.422 --> 00:01:18.716
Kep shook his head.

17
00:01:18.716 --> 00:01:20.601
"Play a game here.

18
00:01:20.602 --> 00:01:25.336
How about Ring Around the Rosy?"

19
00:01:25.337 --> 00:01:32.755
"Boring!" Peter said.

20
00:01:32.756 --> 00:01:48.384
Kep barked.

21
00:01:48.385 --> 00:01:54.388
He ran around the lambs.

22
00:01:54.389 --> 00:02:01.848
At last everyone was in the yard.

23
00:02:01.849 --> 00:02:04.307
"Whew!" Kep said.

24
00:02:04.308 --> 00:02:06.848
"I'm tired!"

25
00:02:06.849 --> 00:02:11.280
Kep lay down under a tree.

26
00:02:11.281 --> 00:02:17.459
Soon he fell asleep.
